TEST 6005 -- MAC movement / thrash
===========================================================================
Run: 2026-09-22 10:49:09  tb470
The case has no steps in ck.db, so it is tested as the title states: the
same source MAC is presented on TWO different DUT ports in turn, and the
forwarding database is read to confirm the entry MOVES rather than
duplicating or sticking.

  rover MAC 0000.aabb.ccdd
  port A = port2.0.2 (tb470 eth2, direct)
  port B = port1.0.2 (tb470 eth1 -> x230 -> DUT)

--- present the MAC on port A ---
